Third-party components
----------------------

Mission Planner and its installed dependencies are supplied by the host installation,
not bundled into the NOMAD DLL artifact. Retain their applicable notices when
redistributing any such software separately.

Historical MAVSDK implementation license texts are retained in licenses/mavsdk-phase-a.
The archived source and dependency provenance remain on the MAVSDK-Archive branch;
MAVSDK and its C++ dependencies are no longer built or linked into the current plugin.

